Boot film
---------
`assets/video/boot.mp4` is a re-encoded derivative of
`assets/videos/1.mp4` from https://github.com/lxj5820/dsh-boot-animation
(that repository is MIT licensed; Copyright (c) 2026 dsh-boot-animation
contributors). Changes made here: 1280x720 H.264 CRF 26, AAC 128 kbps with
loudness normalisation, `moov` moved to the front (faststart), and the clip
was cut to the 8.1 s used by this plugin.

